  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ちからを　ふりしぼり　こうげきする。\nじぶんの　ＨＰが　すくないほど\nわざの　いりょくは　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "힘을 쥐어짜서 공격한다.\n자신의 HP가 적을수록\n기술의 위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "竭盡全力進行攻擊。\n自己的ＨＰ越少，\n招式的威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur ne retient plus ses coups.\nPlus ses PV sont bas, plus l’attaque est puissante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Richtet mehr Schaden an, wenn eigene KP niedrig sind.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataque desesperado que causa más daño cuantos\nmenos PS tenga el usuario.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca con tutte le sue forze.\nPiù i PS sono bassi, maggiore è la potenza\ndi questa mossa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An all-out attack that becomes more powerful the\nless HP the user has.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "力を　ふりしぼり　攻撃する。\n自分の　ＨＰが　少ないほど\n技の　威力は　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "竭尽全力进行攻击。\n自己的ＨＰ越少，\n招式的威力越大。",
